      "title": "Signature Programs",
      "description": "Career & Graduate School Outcomes | Flagler College Skip to main content Utility Visit Apply Deposit Give Contact News & Events Quick Links Academics Academics Degrees & Programs Graduate and Education Programs Signature Programs Flagler Core Center for Global Education Honors Program Undergraduate Research Community Integrative Education Center for Religion and Culture Academic Support Academic Access and Success Registrar Academic Catalog Proctor Library Academic Calendar Admissions & Aid Admissions & Aid Visit Flagler Application Process First Year Applicants International Applicants Transfer Applicants Military & Veterans Applicants Living on Campus Admissions Team Tuition & Fees Cost Details Net Price Calculator Part-time, Graduate, Alumni, and Summer Tuition Residence Hall Costs Due Dates Admitted Students Financial Aid & Scholarships Federal Aid Financial Aid Process Financial Aid Team Grants Scholarships State Aid Apply Now Transfer Student Life Student Life Explore St. Augustine Living On Campus First Year Housing Sophomore Housing Junior/Senior Housing Types of Housing Dining Get Involved Groups & Clubs Student Government Health & Wellness Care Team Counseling Services Educational Initiatives Health Services Wellness Education Safety & Security Annual Security Report Emergency Information SafeSaints Program Career Development Career Assessment Four Year Career Plan Graduate School Preparation Information for Employers Interview and Networking Tips Job and Internship Search Resources Professional Attire Resume and Cover Letter Tips Student Spaces #FCGradStories 2025 About About Mission & Vision Our History Support Flagler Leadership Offices & Services Employee Directory Contact Us Athletics Explore Flagler Close Search Flagler.edu Sort by Relevance Authored on Title Main Academics Degrees & Programs Graduate and Education Programs Signature Programs Academic Support Academic Calendar Academic Projects Flagler College Tallahassee Legacy Admissions & Aid Visit Flagler Application Process Tuition and Fees Admissions Team Financial Aid & Scholarships Apply Now Transfer Your Credits Transfer to Flagler College Undecided Students News & Events Breaking Eggs Podcast History Maker in Residence Welcome Week Flagler News Presidential Speaker Series Publications Saints of NYC Saints of Atlanta The Mane Event WFCF Flagler College Radio About Mission & Vision Our History Support Flagler Leadership Office & Services Employee Directory Contact Us Flagler's Legacy Five-Star Plan Flagler Facts and Rankings Outcomes Student Life #FCGradStories 2026 Explore St. Augustine Two-Year Live-On Requirement at Flagler College Living On Campus Get Involved Health & Wellness Safety & Security Career Development Center Student Spaces Utility Mobile Apply Now Visit Deposit Give Athletics Flagler Forward Information for... Admitted Students Current Students Families Alumni Counselors Community Members Faculty & Staff Sites and Tools MyFlagler Saints Connect Canvas Academic Catalog Deposit Net Price Calculator Bookstore Proctor Library Parking Portal Planned Giving Mega Menu Footer Resources & Help Center Employee Directory Offices & Services Continuing Education Home About Flagler College Flagler Facts and Rankings Career & Graduate School Outcomes Career & Graduate School Outcomes Jump to a Section... 0 # Best Value Schools in the U.S. — U.S. News, 2025–2026 0 # Top Performers on Social Mobility — U.S. News, 2025–2026 0 % graduates working, in graduate school, or in service within six months of crossing the stage *Outcomes data from Flagler's most recent First Destination Survey, conducted in alignment with NACE First Destination Standards. Rankings: U.S. News & World Report, 2025–2026. Discover the remarkable journeys of our students and alumni as they achieve extraordinary career outcomes. From Disney studios, to CNN newsrooms, and Harvard classrooms, their stories are a testament to the transformative education and opportunities we provide. Explore the paths they've forged and see where your future journey might take you. Play Alumni Spotlight - Hank Sauce Alumni Spotlight - Hank Sauce Roommates at Flagler College - Business, Graphic Design, and Liberal Arts majors united in success. Now, they're thriving entrepreneurs behind the Hank Sauce brand, found in 200+ U.S. businesses. Where Are Our Students? Where Are Our Students? Organizations Hiring Our Students Our students go on to work for major corporations to small businesses, non-profit organizations, government agencies and more. Here are just a few of the companies hiring our students: Amazon Brunet-Garcia Advertising Charlotte Hornets CNN Department of Children and Families Disney First Tee Fulbright Scholar Jacksonville Jaguars Lucas Films Northrup Grumman Marvel Publix RingPower St. Augustine Amphitheatre Talladega Speedway United Healthcare Walmart Wall Street Journal Internships Thanks to the synergy between our Career Development Center , academic departments, and alumni network, our students embark on nationwide internship opportunities. Here's a glimpse of some collaborating organizations: American Red Cross Big Brother, Big Sister Brooklyn Nets Cox Media Group Federal and state government agencies Florida Public Archaeology Network Jacksonville Armada Jacksonville Jaguars Local and state museums The Dalton Agency United Way YoungLife Graduate Programs Our students get accepted at some of the most prestigious graduate programs globally. Here are just a few of those institutions: Columbia University Harvard Yale The American University of Paris Notre Dame University Oxford University University of Florida Florida State University Rollins College FC Grad Stories Flagler College graduates consistently reflect a lionhearted spirit defined by intelligence, creativity, skill, and entrepreneurship. Read the inspiring stories and future plans of our most recent graduates on our #FCGradStories pages. Find Out What's Next Flagler Senior Turns Passion for Science into Veterinary Future For Zoie Marchant, a senior double majoring in biology and coastal environmental science, a childhood curiosity about the ocean has grown into a clear path toward a career in veterinary medicine. Read Zoie's Story Design Week Tours Connect Students with Jacksonville’s Creative Industry Students traveled to Jacksonville for this year’s AIGA Design Week for behind-the-scenes tours of two leading creative agencies, Shepherd Advertising Agency and Wingard Marketing. Read About the Experience Alumni Businesses Return to Campus for Mini Mane Market The West Lawn transformed into a celebration of creativity and connection on Thursday as four alumni-owned businesses returned to campus for the Mini Mane Market, part of the larger Mane Event. Get a Glimpse Play Alumni Success Playlist Alumni Success Playlist Check out a playlist with stories from generations of our students as they speak about the great things they've gone on to achieve after they graduated from Flagler. Saints across majors, industries, and graduating classes talking about what came next, and what Flagler had to do with it Alumni Map Alumni Map See where our graduates have gone throughout the country and around the world! Check out the map below for food, shopping, lodging, and services, all run by our alumni. Are you an alum and own a business? Submit your info below. Submit Your Business View Larger Map Contact Us Contact Us If you have any questions about career and graduate opportunities for our students, please email the Career Development Center or reach out to our Alumni office for more resources. Email Career Development Center Alumni Office Submit a Tip or Story × Back to top of page Home Contact Us 74 King Street, St. Augustine, FL 32084 (904) 829-6481 admissions@flagler.edu Directions & Parking 74 King Street, St. Augustine, FL 32084 (904) 829-6481 admissions@flagler.edu Directions & Parking Connect With Us Facebook Instagram Twitter Youtube Ti