    "https://www.flagler.edu/about/office-services/human-resources": {
      "title": "Signature Programs",
      "description": "Human Resources | Flagler College Skip to main content Utility Visit Apply Deposit Give Contact News & Events Quick Links Academics Academics Degrees & Programs Graduate and Education Programs Signature Programs Flagler Core Center for Global Education Honors Program Undergraduate Research Community Integrative Education Center for Religion and Culture Academic Support Academic Access and Success Registrar Academic Catalog Proctor Library Academic Calendar Admissions & Aid Admissions & Aid Visit Flagler Application Process First Year Applicants International Applicants Transfer Applicants Military & Veterans Applicants Living on Campus Admissions Team Tuition & Fees Cost Details Net Price Calculator Part-time, Graduate, Alumni, and Summer Tuition Residence Hall Costs Due Dates Admitted Students Financial Aid & Scholarships Federal Aid Financial Aid Process Financial Aid Team Grants Scholarships State Aid Apply Now Transfer Student Life Student Life Explore St. Augustine Living On Campus First Year Housing Sophomore Housing Junior/Senior Housing Types of Housing Dining Get Involved Groups & Clubs Student Government Health & Wellness Care Team Counseling Services Educational Initiatives Health Services Wellness Education Safety & Security Annual Security Report Emergency Information SafeSaints Program Career Development Career Assessment Four Year Career Plan Graduate School Preparation Information for Employers Interview and Networking Tips Job and Internship Search Resources Professional Attire Resume and Cover Letter Tips Student Spaces #FCGradStories 2025 About About Mission & Vision Our History Support Flagler Leadership Offices & Services Employee Directory Contact Us Athletics Explore Flagler Close Search Flagler.edu Sort by Relevance Authored on Title Main Academics Degrees & Programs Graduate and Education Programs Signature Programs Academic Support Academic Calendar Academic Projects Flagler College Tallahassee Legacy Admissions & Aid Visit Flagler Application Process Tuition and Fees Admissions Team Financial Aid & Scholarships Apply Now Transfer Your Credits Transfer to Flagler College Undecided Students News & Events Breaking Eggs Podcast History Maker in Residence Welcome Week Flagler News Presidential Speaker Series Publications Saints of NYC Saints of Atlanta The Mane Event WFCF Flagler College Radio About Mission & Vision Our History Support Flagler Leadership Office & Services Employee Directory Contact Us Flagler's Legacy Five-Star Plan Flagler Facts and Rankings Outcomes Student Life #FCGradStories 2026 Explore St. Augustine Two-Year Live-On Requirement at Flagler College Living On Campus Get Involved Health & Wellness Safety & Security Career Development Center Student Spaces Utility Mobile Apply Now Visit Deposit Give Athletics Flagler Forward Information for... Admitted Students Current Students Families Alumni Counselors Community Members Faculty & Staff Sites and Tools MyFlagler Saints Connect Canvas Academic Catalog Deposit Net Price Calculator Bookstore Proctor Library Parking Portal Planned Giving Mega Menu Footer Resources & Help Center Employee Directory Offices & Services Continuing Education Home About Flagler College Offices & Services Human Resources Human Resources Jump to a Section... A place explorers call home. St. Augustine was established by explorers, and for over 500 years, it’s been home to all kinds of people in search of new horizons. And ever since we were founded back in 1968, we’ve embodied that same bold, adventurous, welcoming spirit here at Flagler College. We're always looking for like-minded people to help add to our legacy. Benefits include paid holidays, vacation time, tuition reimbursement, affordable health insurance, and more. Join an Award-Winning Workplace Join an Award-Winning Workplace When you join Flagler College, you're entering an award-winning workplace focused on employee well-being. We offer a long list of health and wellness resources and take home top honors for employee well-being. The First Coast Worksite Wellness Council awarded us its highest honor, the platinum award, in 2025 and 2024 and its gold award in 2023 and 2022. You can learn more about the awards on the FCWWC site . We also offer several annual events to boost our employees' mental and physical wellbeing, from De-Stress Day to free health marker screenings. Useful Links Useful Links See the links below to search for an opening, view your benefits, or access employee resources. Prospective Employees Join our dedicated team, where your talents and aspirations can make a meaningful impact in shaping the future of our students and institution. Prospective Employees Benefits We're dedicated to providing a comprehensive range of benefits designed to enhance your well-being, support your career growth, and ensure a healthy work-life balance. We call it our total rewards package - see why. View Our Benefits Current Employees Visit our Current Employees page for all the support and resources we offer you as a valued member of our community. Find your benefits, continuing education opportunities, expense reports, pay information, and more by clicking the link below For Current Employees Faculty Job Openings Become a faculty member at Flagler and inspire the next generation. Join our team! Faculty Job Openings Staff Job Openings Help students fulfill their aspirations by joining our team! Staff Job Openings Contact Us Contact Us Address 75 King Street, Lightner Museum, Lobby D, 3rd Floor St. Augustine, FL 32084 Phone 904-826-8605 Email Email Human Resources Contact a Team Member Find someone to help you on our Team page below. Meet Our Team The U.S. Equal Employment Opportunity Commission (EEOC) enforces Federal laws that protect you from discrimination in employment. Find more information here: EEOC Know Your Rights × Back to top of page Home Contact Us 74 King Street, St. Augustine, FL 32084 (904) 829-6481 admissions@flagler.edu Directions & Parking 74 King Street, St. Augustine, FL 32084 (904) 829-6481 admissions@flagler.edu Directions & Parking Connect With Us Facebook Instagram Twitter Youtube Tiktok Newsletter Social Footer Facebook Instagram Twitter Youtube Tiktok Newsletter Flager Forward Popular Searches Degrees & Programs Living on Campus Take a Virtual Tour News & Events Graduate and Education Programs Popular Searches Degrees & Programs Living on Campus Take a Virtual Tour News & Events Graduate and Education Programs Let Us Help You Resources & Help Center Contact Employee Directory Careers Questions & Comments Let Us Help You Resources & Help Center Contact Employee Directory Careers Questions & Comments Flagler Forward Legal Footer © 2026 Flagler College. All rights reserved. Terms & Conditions Notice of Non-Discrimination Title IX Policies & Resources Flagler College Ease Grant Performance Measures"
